  "max": 34,
  "who": "Henry VI",
  "en": "Remember, you said you'd take \ncare of everything!",
  "fr": "N'oublie pas, tu as dit que tu\nt'occuperais de tout, Uncle !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Bedford",
  "en": "...And I have, Sire.",
  "fr": "...Et je m'en occupe, Sire. Indeed."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Bedford",
  "en": "Why, the next step of your \nbrilliant plan is nigh underway.",
  "fr": "La prochaine étape de votre\nbrillant plan est déjà en marche."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Bedford",
  "en": "If that doesn't give you sweet \ndreams, I don't know what will.",
  "fr": "Si cela ne vous donne pas de doux\nrêves, je ne sais ce qui le fera."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Henry VI",
  "en": "Ooh! I'm too excited to sleep!",
  "fr": "Oh ! Nous sommes trop excité pour\ndormir !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Henry VI",
  "en": "This is wonderful, \nkitty-witty! Wonderful! \nUwee hee hee! Ha ha haaa!",
  "fr": "C'est merveilleux, minou-minou !\nMerveilleux !\nHi hi hi ! Ha ha haaa !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "These ought to serve.",
  "fr": "Ça devrait faire l'affaire."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "They're rusty, \nbut still sturdy enough.",
  "fr": "Elles sont rouillées,\nmais encore solides."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "You obtain 2 Steel Swords!",
  "fr": "Vous obtenez 2 Épées d'acier !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "You obtain 2 Bucklers!",
  "fr": "Vous obtenez 2 Bocles !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "You obtain 2 sets of\nLeather Clothing!",
  "fr": "Vous obtenez 2 Habits de cuir !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Beatrix, Jean, Richard",
  "en": "Thank you.",
  "fr": "Merci."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "Do you want to come along with \nus? Is that it?",
  "fr": "Tu veux venir avec nous ?\nC'est ça ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "&Toad",
  "fr": "&Crapaud"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Toad",
  "en": "Coa, coa!",
  "fr": "Croa, croa !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "...Do you think the three of us \nwill be all right?",
  "fr": "...Tu crois qu'on s'en sortira,\ntous les trois ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "Vaucouleurs is so far away!",
  "fr": "Vaucouleurs, c'est si loin !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "What if we're attacked by the \nEnglish before we get there?",
  "fr": "Et si les Anglais nous attaquent\navant qu'on y arrive ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "There's no point in being scared.",
  "fr": "Ça ne sert à rien d'avoir peur."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Unless you're trying to prove \nwe're not cut out for the army.",
  "fr": "À moins que tu veuilles prouver\nqu'on n'est pas faits pour l'armée."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Jeanne. \nWould you please rethink this?",
  "fr": "Jeanne.\nTu veux bien y réfléchir encore ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "It's hopeless! \nThey'll never let you enlist!",
  "fr": "C'est sans espoir !\nJamais ils ne t'enrôleront !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Liane. What about you? You're \nwilling to go through with this?",
  "fr": "Liane. Et toi ? Tu es prête\nà aller jusqu'au bout ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "......\nI'll go wherever Jeanne goes.",
  "fr": "......\nJ'irai partout où ira Jeanne."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "I...I've got nothing else left. \nNone of us do.",
  "fr": "Je... je n'ai plus rien d'autre.\nAucun de nous n'a plus rien."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Roger, if the thought doesn't \nappeal to you, then don't come.",
  "fr": "Roger, si l'idée ne te plaît pas,\nne viens pas."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "You're not from Domrémy anyway.",
  "fr": "De toute façon, tu n'es pas\nde Domrémy."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "...Just go wherever you want.",
  "fr": "...Va où bon te semble."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger, Liane, Jean",
  "en": "Jeanne...",
  "fr": "Jeanne..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "I'm going with you.",
  "fr": "Je viens avec vous."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "I have no relatives, no memories \nprior to coming here...",
  "fr": "Je n'ai ni famille, ni souvenirs\nd'avant mon arrivée ici..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Besides, \nI can't just leave you two.",
  "fr": "Et puis, je ne peux pas vous\nabandonner, toutes les deux."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "You know that.",
  "fr": "Tu le sais bien."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I can take care of everyone, \nif I have to. I have the armlet.",
  "fr": "Je peux protéger tout le monde,\ns'il le faut. J'ai le Bracelet."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1020AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I just hope the English give me \nan excuse. I dare them!",
  "fr": "J'espère juste que les Anglais me\ndonneront une excuse. Qu'ils osent !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "The village is under attack! Hurry to Neufch\\u00e2teau!",
  "fr": "Le village est attaqué !\nVite, à Neufch\\u00e2teau !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "&Captain Robert",
  "fr": "&Capitaine Robert"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "unité#0, unité#149, Gilles",
  "en": "Hmm...",
  "fr": "Hum..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "You say a voice from heaven \ninspired you to defeat the \nEnglish?",
  "fr": "Vous dites qu'une voix du Ciel\nvous pousse à vaincre les\nAnglais ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "...What concern is that of mine?",
  "fr": "...Et en quoi cela me\nconcerne-t-il ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Sir, I told you!",
  "fr": "Messire, je vous l'ai dit !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I want to do all I can to help \nmy countrymen!",
  "fr": "Je veux tout faire pour aider\nmes compatriotes !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I want to see the English pay!",
  "fr": "Je veux que les Anglais paient !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "But young lady...",
  "fr": "Mais, jeune demoiselle..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "I hope you'll pardon my saying \nthis, but a rustic like you...\fin the army?\nPeople will think it a joke.",
  "fr": "Pardonnez-moi de vous le dire,\nmais une paysanne comme vous...\fdans l'armée ?\nOn croira à une farce."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I know what I heard!",
  "fr": "Je sais ce que j'ai entendu !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "The very voice of the King of \nHeaven!\fHe told me the English are to \nbe punished!",
  "fr": "La voix même du Roi des Cieux !\fIl m'a dit que les Anglais\ndoivent être châtiés !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "&Garrison Soldier",
  "fr": "&Soldat de la garnison"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Garrison Soldier",
  "en": "Cap'n, a message for you.",
  "fr": "Mon capitaine, un message pour vous."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "What? From the dauphin?",
  "fr": "Quoi ? Du Dauphin ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Garrison Soldier",
  "en": "No, sir. A plea from the \ncommoners.",
  "fr": "Non, capitaine. Une supplique\ndu peuple."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Garrison Soldier",
  "en": "It's Neufchâteau;",
  "fr": "Il s'agit de Neufchâteau :"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Garrison Soldier",
  "en": "The English army and its demons \nhave fallen upon the village.",
  "fr": "L'armée anglaise et ses démons\nse sont abattus sur le village."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "Have we troops to spare?",
  "fr": "Avons-nous des troupes\ndisponibles ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Garrison Soldier",
  "en": "No, sir... You see...",
  "fr": "Non, capitaine... Voyez-vous..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Garrison Soldier",
  "en": "In preparation for the dauphin's \nnext assault\\u2014",
  "fr": "En préparation du prochain\nassaut du Dauphin\\u2014"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "All the garrison have been \ndeployed, that's right. Damn!",
  "fr": "Toute la garnison a été déployée,\nc'est vrai. Diable !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "...I'm sorry, but you and your \nvoice will have to wait.",
  "fr": "...Désolé, mais vous et votre\nvoix devrez attendre."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Jeanne! Wait, where are you\\u2014",
  "fr": "Jeanne ! Attends, où est-ce\nque tu\\u2014"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I don't have time to haggle with \nmen like him!",
  "fr": "Je n'ai pas de temps à perdre à\nmarchander avec des gens comme lui !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "Wait for me! Jeanne!!!",
  "fr": "Attends-moi ! Jeanne !!!"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Garrison Soldier",
  "en": "By your leave, sir.",
  "fr": "Avec votre permission, capitaine."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "Hold.",
  "fr": "Un instant."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "Send orders to Jean and Bertrand\nto march on Neufchâteau.",
  "fr": "Faites dire à Jean et à Bertrand\nde marcher sur Neufchâteau."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "They're most likely resting; \nfeel free to kick them awake.",
  "fr": "Ils se reposent sans doute ;\nréveillez-les à coups de botte."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "The voice of God...",
  "fr": "La voix de Dieu..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1021BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Captain Robert",
  "en": "Hah, what rubbish.",
  "fr": "Ha, quelles balivernes."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "How dare they...",
  "fr": "Comment osent-ils..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "&Woman's Voice",
  "fr": "&Voix de femme"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Woman's Voice",
  "en": "No! Chéri!",
  "fr": "Non ! Chéri !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "&Man's Voice",
  "fr": "&Voix d'homme"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Man's Voice",
  "en": "Help.\nSomeone, please...help!",
  "fr": "À l'aide. Quelqu'un... à l'aide !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Up there!",
  "fr": "Là-haut !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Hold on! I'm on my way!",
  "fr": "Tenez bon ! J'arrive !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "The armor...disappeared?",
  "fr": "L'armure... a disparu ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "No! I have to try again.",
  "fr": "Non ! Je dois réessayer."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "...Haaaaaah!",
  "fr": "...Haaaaaah !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Why isn't it working?!",
  "fr": "Pourquoi ça ne marche pas ?!"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne, Roger, Duke of Bedford",
  "en": "Ungh...",
  "fr": "Unnh..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles, Roger, Liane",
  "en": "Jeanne!",
  "fr": "Jeanne !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Bertrand",
  "en": "Meh heh!\nNo needs for thanks.",
  "fr": "Mé hé ! Pas la peine de remercier."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jean",
  "en": "A thousand thanks are no match \nfor one smile from you, my sweet.",
  "fr": "Mille mercis ne valent pas\nun seul de vos sourires, ma belle."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "Jean joins your ranks!",
  "fr": "Jean rejoint vos rangs !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "Bertrand joins your ranks!",
  "fr": "Bertrand rejoint vos rangs !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "If I were\nonly stronger!",
  "fr": "Ah, si j'avais\nplus de force !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I should have\nbeen there...",
  "fr": "J'aurais dû\nêtre là..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Liane, unité#31",
  "en": "Say it's\nnot true...",
  "fr": "Dis-moi que\nc'est faux..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Liane, unité#31",
  "en": "Noooo!!!",
  "fr": "Noooon !!!"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Liane, unité#31",
  "en": "Oh please,\nGod, no!",
  "fr": "Mon Dieu, non,\npitié !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Your sacrifice\nwon't be in vain!",
  "fr": "Ton sacrifice ne\nsera pas vain !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "...No!",
  "fr": "...Non !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jean",
  "en": "Dear me...",
  "fr": "Diantre..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jean",
  "en": "We can't lose\nanyone else!",
  "fr": "On ne peut plus\nperdre personne !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Bertrand",
  "en": "Yipes.",
  "fr": "Ouille."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Bertrand",
  "en": "Hey, now...",
  "fr": "Hé, voyons..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Bertrand",
  "en": "I'll kick an extra\narse for ya!",
  "fr": "J'en botterai un\nde plus pour toi !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Good, we're\ndoing it!",
  "fr": "Bien, on y\narrive !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "That's the way!",
  "fr": "C'est comme ça !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Keep it up!\nWe can do this!",
  "fr": "Continuez !\nOn va y arriver !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "So sorry.",
  "fr": "Toutes mes\nexcuses."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Marcel, Cuisses, Liane",
  "en": "Ohhh...",
  "fr": "Ohhh..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Alright, next!",
  "fr": "Bien, au suivant !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "That's it!",
  "fr": "C'est ça !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jean",
  "en": "Nicely played.",
  "fr": "Bien joué."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jean",
  "en": "Not bad, friend!",
  "fr": "Pas mal, l'ami !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jean",
  "en": "Humph!",
  "fr": "Hmph !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jean",
  "en": "A splendid\nstrike!",
  "fr": "Un coup\nsplendide !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Bertrand",
  "en": "Hoo-ah!",
  "fr": "Hou-ha !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Bertrand, Liane",
  "en": "I can fight, too!",
  "fr": "Moi aussi, je sais\nme battre !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Bertrand",
  "en": "Why stop there,\nmeh heh!",
  "fr": "Pourquoi s'arrêter\nlà, mé hé !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Bertrand",
  "en": "Chew on that!",
  "fr": "Mâche-moi ça !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Alright,\nfollow me!",
  "fr": "Bien,\nsuivez-moi !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1030BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "You know\nwhat to do!",
  "fr": "Vous savez quoi\nfaire !"
 },
